  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth (Cognito)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (obtener accessToken)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/x-amz-json-1.1"
              },
              {
                "key": "X-Amz-Target",
                "value": "AWSCognitoIdentityProviderService.InitiateAuth"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{cognitoEndpoint}}/",
              "host": [
                "{{cognitoEndpoint}}"
              ],
              "path": []
            },
            "description": "Llama DIRECTO a Cognito (no pasa por nginx/backend) usando USER_PASSWORD_AUTH. Guarda el accessToken en la variable de coleccion {{accessToken}} — el resto de requests de esta coleccion ya lo usan automaticamente (Bearer Token heredado). Requisito: el App Client de Cognito debe tener habilitado el auth flow ALLOW_USER_PASSWORD_AUTH (Cognito console -> User pool -> App clients -> tu client -> Authentication flows). Cambia {{username}} / {{password}} en las variables de la coleccion antes de correrlo.",
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"AuthFlow\": \"USER_PASSWORD_AUTH\",\n  \"ClientId\": \"{{cognitoClientId}}\",\n  \"AuthParameters\": {\n    \"USERNAME\": \"{{username}}\",\n    \"PASSWORD\": \"{{password}}\"\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const data = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (data.AuthenticationResult && data.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", data.AuthenticationResult.AccessToken);",
                  "    console.log(\"accessToken guardado en la variable de coleccion\");",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log(\"No se recibio AuthenticationResult - revisa USERNAME/PASSWORD, o si ALLOW_USER_PASSWORD_AUTH esta habilitado en el App Client de Cognito.\");",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Login devuelve AccessToken\", function () {",
                  "    pm.expect(data.AuthenticationResult).to.have.property(\"AccessToken\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "description": "Corre 'Login' primero — todo lo demas depende del token que guarda acá."
    },
